cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "inlaops: Deployment, Versioning and Scoring Tools for inlabru Models"
abstract: >-
  Serves Bayesian spatial and latent Gaussian models fit with inlabru as
  versioned REST APIs. Includes a vetiver bridge (versioning, REST API
  serving with posterior uncertainty, Docker packaging) for bru objects, a
  parsnip model constructor scoped to fixed-effects models, and proper
  scoring rule helpers via inlabru::generate().
